Package: ymax
Version: 1.0.30
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.0.0)
Maintainer: Yamin <https://github.com/needyamin>
Description: Terminal-first coding and operations agent
 YamX (ymax) is a terminal-first coding and operations agent
 designed for practical local work: debugging, log inspection,
 repository editing, DevOps, network diagnostics, and defensive
 security tasks. Offline-first with optional AI augmentation.
